# Extension Build Workflow

## Packaging (each time we make changes)

When making changes to the extension:
- **Bump the version** in `package.json` (e.g. 0.1.8 → 0.1.9)
- Run `npm run compile` in the extension folder
- Run `vsce package` to produce the .vsix (e.g. `yms-zendoc-0.1.9.vsix`)

Bumping version each time avoids Cursor cache issues when testing on another machine.
